{"4632030":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Defi's Devotion","steam_appid":4632030,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE RETURNED<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No longer merely experimenting with forbidden forces, you are on the brink of completing the final blasphemous ritual that will bind your soul to undeath forever. Your phylactery demands power drawn from the living, and every soul you claim brings you closer to eternal dominion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your path to lichhood by choosing a form with unique powers to evolve and master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/98405beecaa5dc0281b1f6683e13ae5d.poster.avif?t=1781828394\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/98405beecaa5dc0281b1f6683e13ae5d.mp4?t=1781828394\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS LANDS TO CONQUER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into boundless worlds that unfold as far as your campaign of decay can push. Every land is newly formed, multiplayer‑ready, and dotted with towns whose fragile systems are easy to corrupt. Spread your power across the expanding terrain and weaken the living wherever they gather.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/69cce48c4058189647e5d69f3fd0f3b0.poster.avif?t=1781828394\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/69cce48c4058189647e5d69f3fd0f3b0.mp4?t=1781828394\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMULATED ECONOMIES FUELING THE OVERSEER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings serve as resources for the Overseer, a powerful entity dedicated to safeguarding life and calling forth heroes. Eliminate the workers, dismantle the buildings, and do everything possible to prevent the Overseer from thwarting your mission.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/c86a96b77ebe7cb53165c59b7cd58228.poster.avif?t=1781828394\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/c86a96b77ebe7cb53165c59b7cd58228.mp4?t=1781828394\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MULTISTRATEGY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a friend on their quest and offer your support. Each Lich has its own unique upgrade path for the zombie horde, so combine your favorite strategies to keep the Overseer on their toes. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/5c732db073132fa5de16d5cffc47701e.avif?t=1781828394\" width=960 height=540 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CORRUPTION DEEPENDS IN EARLY ACCESS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defi's Devotion has more growing to do before it can be released. More content is on the horizon to fill out the hero roster and expand the strategies for your conquest; secrets and puzzles that unlock new powers extending the lore of the world. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer, this project enters Early Access to grow its systems and expand them over time. Player feedback will shape the push and pull between decay and control, guiding your rise toward ascension.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE RETURNED<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No longer merely experimenting with forbidden forces, you are on the brink of completing the final blasphemous ritual that will bind your soul to undeath forever. Your phylactery demands power drawn from the living, and every soul you claim brings you closer to eternal dominion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your path to lichhood by choosing a form with unique powers to evolve and master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/98405beecaa5dc0281b1f6683e13ae5d.poster.avif?t=1781828394\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/98405beecaa5dc0281b1f6683e13ae5d.mp4?t=1781828394\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS LANDS TO CONQUER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into boundless worlds that unfold as far as your campaign of decay can push. Every land is newly formed, multiplayer‑ready, and dotted with towns whose fragile systems are easy to corrupt. Spread your power across the expanding terrain and weaken the living wherever they gather.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/69cce48c4058189647e5d69f3fd0f3b0.poster.avif?t=1781828394\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/69cce48c4058189647e5d69f3fd0f3b0.mp4?t=1781828394\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMULATED ECONOMIES FUELING THE OVERSEER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings serve as resources for the Overseer, a powerful entity dedicated to safeguarding life and calling forth heroes. Eliminate the workers, dismantle the buildings, and do everything possible to prevent the Overseer from thwarting your mission.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/c86a96b77ebe7cb53165c59b7cd58228.poster.avif?t=1781828394\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/c86a96b77ebe7cb53165c59b7cd58228.mp4?t=1781828394\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MULTISTRATEGY<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a friend on their quest and offer your support. Each Lich has its own unique upgrade path for the zombie horde, so combine your favorite strategies to keep the Overseer on their toes. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/extras\/5c732db073132fa5de16d5cffc47701e.avif?t=1781828394\" width=960 height=540 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CORRUPTION DEEPENDS IN EARLY ACCESS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defi's Devotion has more growing to do before it can be released. More content is on the horizon to fill out the hero roster and expand the strategies for your conquest; secrets and puzzles that unlock new powers extending the lore of the world. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer, this project enters Early Access to grow its systems and expand them over time. Player feedback will shape the push and pull between decay and control, guiding your rise toward ascension.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Become the plague in an asymmetrical player verses simulation battle for immortality. Infect populations, collapse economies, and harvest the dead to fuel your path to lichhood; only if you can conquer an adaptive world fighting to survive.","supported_languages":"영어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/e4d0c5dc301bdf02d45e7375d75e0f06236caa58\/header.jpg?t=1781828394","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/3d35e40afc25f8921a39a26b18c2cde8ce090a48\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781828394","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4632030\/3d35e40afc25f8921a39a26b18c2cde8ce090a48\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781828394","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> 64-bit Windows 10, 11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 3.0 GHz Quad Core CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1060 with 3GB of video RAM or Radeon RX 580 with 4GB of video RAM or Intel Arc A380<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 2 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> 64-bit Windows 10, 11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 3.6 GHz Quad Core CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GeForce RTX or Radeon RX5600 or Intel Arc A580 or above<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 2 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Sean Pearson"],"publishers":["Mythberry Studio"],"price_overview":{"currency":"KRW","initial":1548000,"final":1548000,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"₩ 15,480"},"packages":[1613266],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Defi's Devotio